============================================================

Before extracting features, run:

src\verify_aal_atlas.py

Expected result:

Size      : PASS
Spacing   : PASS
Origin    : PASS
Direction : PASS

The atlas should contain:

116 non-zero ROI labels.

Expected label range:

Minimum label: 2001
Maximum label: 9170

If atlas verification fails:

STOP feature extraction.

Do not try to "fix" the atlas automatically by using a different atlas.

