21. RESUME / SKIP LOGIC
============================================================

The automation MUST be resumable.

If the process is interrupted:

DO NOT restart everything from the beginning.

For every stage, check whether the expected output already exists and is valid.

Examples:

If N4 output exists:
    skip N4.

If HD-BET output exists:
    skip HD-BET.

If MNI registration output exists:
    verify geometry and skip registration if valid.

If registration QC exists:
    do not regenerate unnecessarily.

If individual AAL feature CSV exists:
    verify it and skip extraction if valid.

If subject already exists in combined feature matrix:
    do not add duplicate row.

This is essential because the processing is computationally expensive on a CPU-only college PC.

